#: src/postulo/core/server_forms.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Yes: somebody who arrives through the identity provider is signed straight in, without being asked for a code as well. Say yes only if you know that provider checks identity at least as carefully as Postulo would. It never applies to a password sign-in, and it removes nobody's authenticator app. A passkey already counts on its own and needs no setting."
msgstr "Bai: identitate-hornitzailearen bidez datorrena zuzenean sartzen da, kode bat ere eskatu gabe. Esan baietz hornitzaile horrek identitatea Postulok bezain arretaz gutxienez egiaztatzen duela badakizu bakarrik. Ez zaio inoiz pasahitz bidezko sarrerari aplikatzen, eta ez dio inori autentifikazio-aplikazioa kentzen. Sarbide-gakoak berez zenbatzen du jada eta ez du ezarpenik behar."

#: src/postulo/core/server_forms.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Yes: somebody who has forgotten their password can ask for a code at their primary address and type it back. A code rather than a link, because mail scanners follow links and would spend one before the person read it. It is never a second factor: an authenticator app is still asked for. Offered only while this instance's mail is actually getting through."
msgstr "Bai: pasahitza ahaztu duenak kode bat eska dezake bere helbide nagusian eta hura idatzi. Kode bat eta ez esteka bat, posta-eskanerrek estekei jarraitzen dietelako eta pertsonak irakurri aurretik gastatuko luketelako. Inoiz ez da bigarren faktorea: autentifikazio-aplikazioa eskatzen da oraindik. Instantzia honen posta benetan iristen den bitartean bakarrik eskaintzen da."

